<title>INDIA: Indian July cement output rises to 6.46 mln tonnes. [CORRECTED 15:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Indian July cement output rises to 6.46 mln tonnes. [CORRECTED 15:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement production rose in July  to 6.46 million tonnes from 5.77 million in the same month in 1995, the government said.</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    Jul 96	Jul 95	 Apr-July</p>
<p>							    1996/97  1995/96</p>
<p>				 6,469	 5,769     25,569   22,529</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
</text>
